CodeBrix patch 0011 - pipeline caches for pipeline creation (wgpu-native/src/lib.rs)

WHAT: wgpuDeviceCreateComputePipeline and wgpuDeviceCreateRenderPipeline pass wgpu-core the pipeline
cache of a WGPUCodebrixPipelineDescriptorExtras chained onto their descriptor (sType
WGPUSType_CodebrixPipelineDescriptorExtras, codebrix_wgpu.h) instead of the hard-coded `cache: None`
behind upstream's `// TODO(wgpu.h)`. The chain is read by codebrix-wgpu/bridge/bridge.rs
(pipeline_cache_of_chain), where the cache handle lives; no chained extras, or a NULL cache, is
`None` exactly as before. wgpu.h's C API is unchanged (the new types and functions are
codebrix_wgpu.h's: wgpuCodebrixDeviceCreatePipelineCache, wgpuCodebrixPipelineCacheGetData,
wgpuCodebrixPipelineCacheAddRef / Release, wgpuCodebrixAdapterGetPipelineCacheKey).
WHY: wgpu-native advertises WGPUNativeFeature_PipelineCache but gives no way to use it, so every
first run on Vulkan recompiles every pipeline (seconds to a minute per material on Android, where no
driver disk cache hides it). Required by CodeBrix.Graphics3D.Cycles (MAINTAINER-README.txt, BUMPING
WGPU, decided 2026-10-22).
UPSTREAM: open draft PR gfx-rs/wgpu-native #618 ("Implement pipeline caches", 2026-07-11, unmerged)
does the same with wgpu.h types (WGPUPipelineCache, WGPUPipelineDescriptorExtras, sType 0x0003000C);
the CodeBrix contract copies its shapes under CodeBrix names. When a vendored release contains it,
drop this patch and move the binding to upstream's names.

--- a/wgpu-native/src/lib.rs
+++ b/wgpu-native/src/lib.rs
@@ -2165,8 +2165,8 @@
             // wgpu's default is true too); `false` let shaders read stale shared memory.
             zero_initialize_workgroup_memory: true,
         },
-        // TODO(wgpu.h)
-        cache: None,
+        // CodeBrix (patches/0011): the pipeline cache of a chained WGPUCodebrixPipelineDescriptorExtras.
+        cache: codebrix_bridge::pipeline_cache_of_chain(descriptor.nextInChain),
     };
 
     let (compute_pipeline_id, error) =
@@ -2454,8 +2454,8 @@
             }),
         // TODO(wgpu.h)
         multiview_mask: None,
-        // TODO(wgpu.h)
-        cache: None,
+        // CodeBrix (patches/0011): the pipeline cache of a chained WGPUCodebrixPipelineDescriptorExtras.
+        cache: codebrix_bridge::pipeline_cache_of_chain(descriptor.nextInChain),
     };
 
     let (render_pipeline_id, error) = context.device_create_render_pipeline(device_id, &desc, None);
